Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.01,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(477,0)\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)}Ohara vs. The World Government
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to tell me,\Ndidn't my mom come by here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you think your\Nmother was back in Ohara?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've severed all bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I can't let her\Nbecome the daughter of a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish she was here, too, but she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard there are navy battleships\Ncoming to the island right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're trying to get rid of\Nall the scholars on Ohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people in town must\Nbe stirring up bad rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, that's no battleship, and\Nthey won't be getting rid of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government is paying\Nus a visit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means the library\Nwill be under an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A harsh one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what those\Ngovernment agents say or do,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you absolutely cannot let them know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you're an archaeologist\Nlike the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're so young,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you keep quiet, no\None will think you're a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your hands in the air and go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're\Nbeing a bit violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The researchers here at\Nthe Tree of Knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are being charged with the heinous crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of deciphering poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be investigating the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so everyone get out of our\Nway and leave the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better treat this place with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The value of this collection is well\Nbeyond your imagination, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to listen to a word you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him outside! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, citizens of Ohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret to inform you that\Nthe scholars of this island
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may be devils in disguise plotting\Nto destroy the world. What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our scholars are the pride\Nof every person in Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would never dream of\Ndoing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will be conducting a large-scale\Nsearch of the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those who are not related to\Nthe research center must take a form
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of identification and head to the\Nevacuation ship on the West Seashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evacuation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the scholars did do something\Nwrong that still has nothing to do with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't kick us off our own island!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only obligation was to\Npass on this message to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disregard our warning if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we won't be held responsible,\Nshould any unfortunate accidents occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in the West Shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have\Nany part of this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a gunner, dammit! A gunner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact the higher-ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them I want my son to take\Nover for me! Calm down, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet went through\Nyour sleeve, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll aim to kill next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Nico Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it hard to believe that a\Ndevious criminal like you would end
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up on this island completely by\Ncoincidence after your daring escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite the fact that you've denied your\Nconnection to the Scholars of Ohara,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've shown up at their doorstep just in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to warn them of our\Nlittle investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, in my humble opinion, that very clearly\Nlabels them as your partners in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no idea why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't prove one single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've cooked up plenty\Nof excuses to cover for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a clever woman, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't really matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we don't have to prove your\Nconnection to the Ohara scholars anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're here, we can search\Nevery little nook and cranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it'll take long before we find\Nevidence of their poneglyph research.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government's quite confident in\Nthis, and you know they're never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been in the\Nworks for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capturing you after six years of hide-and-seek\Nwas nothing more than the final push.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of poneglyph\Nresearchers around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and each time we captured one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we tried to find any connection\Nthey might have to Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making an example of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we crush this holy\Nground of archaeology,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the entire academic\Nworld will take notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect opportunity\Nto show the world exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happens to those who\Nresearch the blank century.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, the battleships from headquarters\Nwaiting on standby are here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a clever woman, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as you might guess, there to ensure\Nthat not even a single criminal escapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, as a matter of form, we\Nstill need to verify their guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I came all this way to conduct\Na compulsory investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the island and chase off\Nanyone who's not involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's curtains for you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the books here are world treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take them outside and shut them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have a secret\Nroom somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop until you find it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.41,0:07:11.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Northwest Coastline, Ohara\N(Saul's Present Location)
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.41,0:07:11.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFFFEFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)}Northwest Coastline, Ohara\N{\c&HE6E6E6&}(Saul's Present Location)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battleships are here already\Nand there's a whole mess of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should be everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, now don't let them go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're rounding\Nup all the scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they were cooking up\Na plan to destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the evacuation ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on the west seashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what might happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, they said there's\Nan evacuation ship waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what the government\Nis going to do anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should get out while you can. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing but mean\Npeople on that stupid boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the same as you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you have the\Nsituation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was quite surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody warned me there were such\Nferocious beasts wandering the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it makes for a fine trophy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Olvia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This woman is an escaped prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We executed her comrades\Nafter we found out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that they'd been\Ndeciphering ancient texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we still have a couple\Nof matters left to clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me be frank here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's your partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just come out with it already so I\Ncan get this over with and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful of them to\Nhurt someone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, for the last time, go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, my little girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've grown so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not careful, they're\Ngoing to burn the whole tree down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought they would\Ntake such drastic measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they aren't holding back, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, is this the chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found a hidden room in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a huge tablet\Nthere, probably a poneglyph,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a massive collection of research\Ndocuments discussing the ancient texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, scholars of Ohara,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your death sentence\Nhas already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to lose so many fine scholars,\Nbut you're really forcing my hand here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.74,0:10:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came all this way just to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'd better report\Nto the five elder stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor, they aren't\Nreally going to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't do that to someone for\Njust learning about history, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may say they're\Nlearning about history,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the truth is they're\Nlearning how to revive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an ancient weapon so they\Ncan commit mass murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would never do anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to discuss the\Nmatter with an errand boy like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really the ancient weapon itself\Nthat the world government is afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on the line now,\NChief. Good. Hold on! Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you put all of us to death, allow\Nme to speak to the five Elder Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although we still have much to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have proudly continued\Nour research for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So at the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to share our hypothesis on\Nthe Void Century with the world's leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, stubborn old fart. Hey! Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hear what I have to\Nsay, you'll become a criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it looks like they found the\Npeople from the library guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of Navy battleships\Nclosing in on the island from the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about to get real ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better evacuate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to get off this\Nisland before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have they made the order\Nfor the Buster Call yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run to the evacuation ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a poneglyph, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard even if we shoot it with a cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it won't leave a single\Nscratch on the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these creepy things\Nare hidden all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the evidence is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for nothing\Nshort of the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're waiting for your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as they've broken the law so\Nblatantly, there's really no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must enforce our own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need your mock\Nsympathy, Elder Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking to the leaders\Nof the world. You damn criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be Professor Clover, Ohara's\Nforemost authority on archaeology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've contributed much to\Nthe world's cultural heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sad to see a man of\Nyour intellect go astray.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The history of this planet\Nbelongs to all of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what that history may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't have the right to\Nforbid us from learning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one does. Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one can read the poneglyphs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it's also possible\Nthat they can revive the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ancient weapons and place\Nthe world in serious peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you have the best of intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone else could come along\Nand use your research for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be it good or bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mankind has the responsibility to\Naccept whatever their history may hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't succumb\Nto fear and ignorance,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will be prepared for\Nanything that may come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's idealistic. Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you just making convenient\Nexcuses to suit your needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, there are two\Nmysteries left unsolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we want to read the Poneglyph,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the reason why they were made in\Nthe first place is interesting as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was their message so important\Nthat they had to inscribe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it on unbreakable stone to\Npass on to future generations?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were they hidden and\Nscattered across the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were they not stored in a library?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only logical conclusion is\Nthat they feared their message
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be too easily destroyed\Nif they had written it on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, they had an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who was afraid of the\Ninformation they wanted to pass on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to\Nimply, Professor Clover?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the ancients have disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must assume that they were defeated\Nby this enemy And that whoever they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they survived through history
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be no coincidence that roughly 800\Nyears in the past When the blank century
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,came to an end The organization we now\Ncall the World Government was founded
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,therefore if this unknown enemy was indeed\Nthe world government it might be in their
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,best interest to erase this inconvenient\Npiece of information and let the ancients
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disappear into a fabricated blank century
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by analyzing ancient\Nmanuscripts and piecing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together what we could\Nfrom the few pornoglyphs
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were able to find we discovered the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,existence of a previously unknown country\Nalthough the details we found were a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scarce we believe it\Nwas a grand and powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:15:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kingdom and yet despite their strength not
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a trace remains or\Nrather those traces were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deliberately erased but they were prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for this possibility even as they faced\Nthe threat of extinction and so they etched
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their history in stone\Nbefore their kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was crushed under the might of the allied
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nations now known as the world government\Nthus the reason why the poneglyphs were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.36,0:15:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made becomes quite clear i see that's a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bold hypothesis it's true that the ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weapons would be a threat to the world but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more so than weapons\Nwhat i believe the world
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government is afraid of is the history
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surrounding this lost\Nkingdom its existence and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its ideologies are so\Ndangerous to you that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would kill to keep\Nthem secret although
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still don't know what makes you fear\Nthis kingdom we do at least know its name
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since we've gone so far already perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like me to\Nshare it with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left us no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you! No! Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohara knows too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may give the order to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or don't move an inch! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't let anyone escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, with a golden transponder snail\Nentrusted to me by Admiral Sengoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I invoked the Buster Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pressed something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stop being so selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.97,0:17:14.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Silver Transponder Snail\NReceiver for the Golden Transponder Snail
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.97,0:17:14.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFFFEFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)}Silver Transponder Snail\N{\c&HE6E6E6&}Receiver for the Golden Transponder Snail
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Buster Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All battleships to your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Tree of Knowledge is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it enough to take our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have caught fire when they\Nbombed your secret basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't replace the documents in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need guns anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for the government\Nagents to pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's put out the fire. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass the water over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carry as many books outside as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring that woman with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still some info\Nwe have to get out of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure she doesn't escape again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Robin, run while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my mother, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind, Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to board this ship or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry and get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never call myself your mother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all these years, after all I've\Ndone, I don't have the right anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so scary, her mom abandoned her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my daughter's\Ndress, you take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Aunt Roji, I\Njust wanted to try it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure eat a lot for a freeloader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl your daughter or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I'm sorry, little girl. You
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must be confusing me with someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it comes to this I don't want\Nyou to be the daughter of a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:21:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. What a weird\Nlittle brat. Right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me! It's Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown since the last time,\Nso maybe you don't recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just once, someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to hold your hand and\Nwalk together like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I studied hard to become an archaeologist\Nso I could go to sea with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can read the Poneglyphs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've waited so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now commencing the Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships fire at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything on the island\Nof Ohara is your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let nothing remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The research conducted here was far\Nmore extensive than we anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure that knowledge is not passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.10,0:22:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not allow it to leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Annihilate the devils of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn it to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you wait till we leave the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.90,0:22:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill us! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:22:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Tree of Knowledge took a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're using their\Nhighest power against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They staged their investigation, but\Nthey were planning this from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.33,0:23:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief, that girl said\Nshe can read the Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she did, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.38,0:23:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's true or not, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably safer to wipe\Nher out, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember her face, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're retreating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll grab Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation has changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.77,0:23:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get blown up trying\Nto follow some stupid order!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our number one priority\Nis keeping me alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire on that\Nside before it spreads!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the library at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting a long time to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.92,0:24:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.58,0:24:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.94,0:24:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my fault for not\Nwatching over you with more care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really true that you\Ncan read the pornoglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to learn, since I\Nwanted to be a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew my little\Ngirl was an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.96,0:24:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.16,0:24:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have studied hard\Nwhile I was gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.54,0:24:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aren't things\Nthat just anyone can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.30,0:24:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.41,0:25:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only ones who know about this are\Nthe officials who were here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to waste any more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alpha, take Robin and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.98,0:25:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can sneak her\Nonto the evacuation ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.52,0:25:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she might still be able\Nto leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.18,0:25:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.20,0:25:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking all\Nover for you. It's Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you met with your mother after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sol, why in the world are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.82,0:25:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it must be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.42,0:25:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just happened to wash up here and your\Nlittle girl was the one who found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we ain't got\Ntime to chat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.18,0:25:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, but I need you to take\Ncare of Robin for me, please. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Olivia, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.18,0:25:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:25:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:26:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose you again! Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.70,0:26:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're a scholar of Ohara,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should know that history\Nis mankind's greatest treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that it's been passed on, it will\Nilluminate the path to your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.38,0:26:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you must pass it on as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or its light will disappear\Nwith the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Share those books!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't take these!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.95,0:26:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't trying to\Nuncover some dark secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we simply wanted to hear the voices\Nof the past and protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our research ends here, but time\Nmarches on, even if Ohara is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as surely as we believe in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.54,0:26:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we believe in the future\Nthat you will inherit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.22,0:26:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her and go, Saul!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.66,0:26:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.74,0:26:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.00,0:26:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you! Mommy! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.16,0:27:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy to hear\Nyou call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my sake as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must live, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.26,0:27:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Kuzan! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.24,0:27:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, it's gotta be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you gonna tell me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out already, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the deserter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.54,0:27:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Saul!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to take me back! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.92,0:27:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Robin! Be proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.28,0:27:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mama's a wonderful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohara's a wonderful place!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you to pass it on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:28:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohara was so brave, they\Nfought against the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.32,0:28:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capturing them is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ain't even pirates, they're scholars!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you so weak you can't reel\Nthem in without blowing them up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shoot down these researcher\Nships one after another,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.02,0:28:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still can't find any sense\Nin killing these poor folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Saul, we found a survivor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.08,0:28:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you need ancient weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even know why you're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Vice Admiral you're speaking to!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weapons are just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.38,0:28:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try thinking about\Nwhat you're doing for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just afraid of a past\Nthat you know nothing about!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a top-secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.78,0:28:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an Alto attack in which five\Nvice-admills command ten battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.04,0:28:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to take part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.50,0:28:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just scholars, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:29:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the ones we've captured before\Ndon't seem like they care about weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want to learn\Nmore about history.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.56,0:29:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If their research is so dangerous, why\Ndon't we help them so nothing goes wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.18,0:29:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least you can do is give me some\Nproof that these folks are bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.22,0:29:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because to me, it seems like\Nwe're the criminals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you questioning the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just follow your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.86,0:29:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.92,0:29:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Admiral Saul has taken\Nthe prisoner and deserted!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows too much about our\Nnext operation. After them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shots all will be at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open fire if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth will be showing up any minute\Nnow, but I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you won't be able to\Nreturn to the Navy after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.04,0:29:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I got this doubt in my heart,\Nain't no point in staying anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the law is the law, but the way\Nthey're acting this time is downright cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.16,0:29:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm following my own sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.76,0:30:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you get to that island\Nand warn your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.86,0:30:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck to you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.28,0:30:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not targeting the\Nidol, we're not targeting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.98,0:30:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hit him! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.53,0:30:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the criminal's accomplice now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.30,0:30:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.98,0:30:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that must have scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait here a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.74,0:30:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the one firing at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you'd hurt that poor\Nlittle girl, you damn fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about justice anymore,\Nbut I do know I can protect my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Saul!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.64,0:30:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if you make an enemy out of\Nme, there's gonna be hell to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.84,0:31:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to tell you.
